<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Blinding Flash</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 45)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast blinding flash</a>
</pre>
<p>The caster closes their eyes and chants, and a small ball of pure light 
bursts with a blinding flash. Everyone in the room is caught in it, except 
the caster, the caster's leader and everyone who follows that leader; other 
players only when both you and they have signed the Book of Blood. It does 
no harm: whoever is dazzled loses a combat round, their next blow coming 
late.
</p><p>Each one resists with their mind and their own skill in the spell against 
yours; those who aren't dazzled growl and attack you. It can be cast while 
fighting, and no free hands are needed. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Stun</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Flash</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>